## General Rules
1. Do not create markdown documentation files unless explicitly requested by the user.
2. When running terminal commands, always use the conda environment named "satnav" (e.g., `conda activate satnav`).
3. When answering questions, only include code if the user specifically requests it or if code is necessary to answer the question. Avoid creating large code snippets unless requested.
